Arabic terminology: some Arabic terms in the dictionaries adopt equivalents from lexicons on the Siwar
platform (https://siwar.ksaa.gov.sa) of the King Salman Global Academy for Arabic Language, and from Saudi
government glossaries and regulations. Equivalents from Siwar lexicons are credited to their lexicon, to the
platform and to the Academy; the others, to their issuing authority. The 33 sources, with their publishers,
are listed on the extension's About page (the options page, extension/options.html). No lexicon data ships
with the project.
